# Chapter 7: before the throne of Lithos, the Mountain King (map 31).
# He wants Lothian buried in his earth.
do: bypass:1900,2100,0,31 from Galious through the Upper Catacombs 2, the Stone Cove and the Hall of the Mountain King (golem at the doors, floating platforms, force fields) to the throne of Lithos
do: keys:0,150;until:free|ask/20000;sayall;until:free/20000
do: journal:text
expect: To become his servant I must bury Lothian in his earth
